## Phase 6 — Cutover & Cleanup

**Goal:** Fully retire Render and confirm everything runs on Vercel only.

Tasks:
1. Confirm zero traffic/errors on Render logs for at least a few days after Phase 3 cutover.
2. Cancel/downgrade the Render service.
3. Update any docs/env references from Render URL to Vercel URL.
4. Final end-to-end test: new YouTube upload → Drop auto-created → admin adds products → shows on site → auto-expires after 5 days, or admin deletes early.

